{title: 354 - Thy Love, O God}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #354 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: D}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 354}
{meta: category Christian Church - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[A]Thy [Bm]love, [A7/G]O God, [D]has [F#m]all [G]mankind [Em]created,
[D]And [Bm/F#]led [D]Thy people [Bm]to [F#m/C#]this present [Bm]hour;
[A]In [D]Christ [Bm]we see [C#dim]life's [A#m]glory [Bm]consummated;
[F#m]Thy [Bm]Spirit [A7/G]manifests [Em]His [F#m]living power.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[A]From [Bm]out [A7/G]the darkness [D]of [F#m]our [G]hope's [Em]frustration,
[D]From [Bm/F#]all [D]the broken [Bm]idols [F#m/C#]of our [Bm]pride,
[A]We [D]turn [Bm]to seek [F#m]Thy [G#]truth's [A#m]illumination,
[F#m]And [Bm]find [A7/G]Thy mercy [Em]waiting [F#m]at our [Em]side.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[A]In [Bm]pity [A7/G]look [D]upon [F#m]Thy [G]children's [Em]striving
[D]For [Bm/F#]life [D]and freedom, [Bm]peace [F#m/C#]and brotherhood,
[A]Till [D]at [Bm]the fullness [G#]of [A#m]Thy [Bm]truth [G#m]arriving,
[F#m]We [Bm]find [A7/G]in Christ the [D]crown [Em]of [F#m]every [Em]good.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[A]Inspire [A7/G]Thy church, [D]mid [Em]earth's [F#m]discordant [Em]voices,
[D]To [Bm/F#]preach [D]the gospel [Bm]of [F#m/C#]her Lord above,
[A]Until [Bm]the day [F#m]this [G#]warring [Bm]world [G#m]rejoices
[F#m]To [Bm]hear [A7/G]the mighty [Em]harmonies [F#m]of [Em]love.
{end_of_verse}
